    "projectDescription": "An AI-powered consumer compliance enforcement system for packaged goods that uses mobile/web product images, OCR and computer vision to extract mandatory declarations such as MRP, quantity, dates, manufacturer and Country of Origin. A machine-checkable Legal Metrology rule engine validates the extracted information, generates an instant compliance score with plain-language violation explanations, and compares physical package data with online listings. The system also creates tamper-evident evidence packs with image and timestamp, while a government risk dashboard helps inspectors identify and prioritise cases for inspection."
